---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const title = 'Guides | salarynegotiationcalc.com';
const description = 'In-depth guides covering key topics at salarynegotiationcalc.com.';
---
<BaseLayout title={title} description={description}>
  <h1>Guides</h1>
  <p>Plain-language guides written and reviewed by our editorial team.</p>
  <h3><a href="/guides/how-to-negotiate-salary">How to Negotiate Salary</a></h3>
  <p>Step-by-step guide to negotiating a job offer: when to negotiate, how to anchor, and how to handle pushback.</p>
  <h3><a href="/guides/salary-research-guide">Salary Research Guide</a></h3>
  <p>How to use Glassdoor, Levels.fyi, LinkedIn Salary, and other sources to build a defensible salary ask.</p>
  <h3><a href="/guides/negotiating-job-offers">Negotiating Job Offers</a></h3>
  <p>How to handle the offer conversation, counter-offers, multiple offers, and accepting or declining professionally.</p>
  <h3><a href="/guides/salary-negotiation-misconceptions">Common Salary Negotiation Misconceptions</a></h3>
  <p>Common misunderstandings about salary negotiation: that it&rsquo;s rude, that offers can be rescinded, and that your current salary caps you.</p>
  <ul style="margin-top:2rem">
    <li><a href="/case-types">Case types overview</a></li>
    <li><a href="/methodology">Calculator methodology</a></li>
  </ul>
</BaseLayout>
